# before running with docker you need to add the secrets


## Do not hard code secrets


`printf "<your secret value>" | docker secret create SECRET_NAME -`


how to build server locally

   ` docker build -t your-express-app-name -f Dockerfile.local .`
    `docker run -p 9090:8080 -e PORT=8080 your-express-app-name `


I havent been able to make docker secrets work. i just run it with `node .` when i run it locally


# If you do not know how to do docker secrets locally then dont run docker locally with secrets. The keys will be compromised 


